Deploy (staging/production)

Frontend (Vercel or other Vite host):
- VITE_SUPABASE_URL
- VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
- VITE_BACKEND_URL
- VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY (new; production public key — do not reuse the local pair in .env.example)
- Site must be HTTPS
- PWA (manifest + sw.js); iPhone closed-app push only after Add to Home Screen

Hosted Supabase:
  npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
  supabase db push
  supabase functions deploy push-on-message
  supabase secrets set VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=<prod-public> VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=<prod-private>
Optional: Database Webhook on messages INSERT to push-on-message with the service role JWT.

Do not put in the frontend:
- VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY
- SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY

Google OAuth:
- Add the production origin and https://<project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback on the Google client.

Generate a new VAPID pair for production; keys in .env.example are local-only.
